  "description_en": "EventPro Software is a product in the Event management category. Its directory profile covers Attendee Management, Weddings (Parties), Travel Management, Trade Shows, Ticketing, Sponsorship Management, Space Setup (Room), Room Block Management.\n\nAdditional listed capabilities include Meetings, Lead Retrieval, Guest List Management, Vendor Management, Conventions, Conferences (Seminars), Client Management, Catering Management. These areas should be evaluated against the tasks, permissions and data involved in the intended workflow.\n\nDeployment is listed as Browser Based (Cloud) Mobile App (Android, iOS) Desktop App (Windows, Mac). The listed organization sizes are All (Small, Medium, Large). API support is listed as Available. Support channels are listed as Business Hours, Online.\n\nThe directory's pricing snapshot states: Free Trial Not Available Offers Custom plan.. This is a dated third-party reference; current amounts, billing periods, trial conditions and regional availability require an official pricing check.",
  "description_zh": "EventPro Software 属于活动管理软件。第三方资料列出的功能包括活动参与者管理、婚礼与聚会适用、差旅管理、贸易展会、票务管理、赞助管理、场地与会议室设置、客房配额管理。\n\n资料还列出会议、线索获取、嘉宾名单管理、供应商管理、展会活动、会议与研讨会、客户管理、餐饮安排管理。选择时应结合实际任务、使用权限和数据处理需求逐项评估。\n\n资料所列运行方式为浏览器访问（云服务） 移动应用 (Android, iOS) 桌面应用 (Windows, Mac)。资料所列适用组织规模为小型、中型与大型组织。API 支持情况为提供。资料所列支持方式为工作时间支持, 在线支持。\n\n第三方定价快照显示：未提供免费试用 另有定制方案。。这属于采集时的第三方参考，实际金额、计费周期、试用条件及地区可用性仍需核对官网。",
